## Build Outputs
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
# dist must exist in a clean clone: nuget.config declares ./dist as a package source and
# NuGet treats a missing source as a hard error (NU1301). The folder is kept by .gitkeep.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
publish/

